Sad Customer was added to the game all the way back during '''Beta 2.3''' and got never changed since its release, until '''Beta 8.1'''. Starting as a 1/4 for 3G monster, it was turned into a 4/5 for 6G one (gaining +3/+1 for +3G). Its effect was also changed from reducing the enemy's gold by 2G to 3G.

'''Beta 13.1''' gave it -1 HP. '''Beta 21.0''' folled that up by reducing the enemy's gold by 2G again. '''Beta 27.0''' gave it +1 ATK. And '''Beta 40.0''' gave it -1/+1, swapped its stats from 5/4 to 4/5, returning them to its Beta 8.1 state (but with the weaker Magic).
