== Trivia ==
* Its change in Beta 8.1 was mostly done to make it more similar to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Gaster_Follower_2 Gaster Follower 2], similar to how [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Goner_Kid Goner Kid] was similar to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Monster_Kid Monster Kid].
** [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Ficus_Licker Ficus Licker], added in Beta 39.1, continued this by being similar to [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Gaster_Follower_1 Gaster Follower 1].
